   "The two streams that carry transients disagree with the Dolby decode around each of them: below 1,2 kHz 30 to 33 dB over the whole stream against a median of 57 to 67 dB frame by frame. The pre-noise correction of the two decoders is not in the same place there. That is a finding of its own and no part of this change.",
